Schema enforcement
Column-name standardization
Datatype conversion
Status normalization
Key validation
Duplicate handling using latest modified_timestamp
Foreign-key validation
Invalid-row quarantine
Speed conversion into Mbps
Price and percentage parsing
Date validation
Total amount and usage recalculation

